From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Find Phone GATT service

The watch asks the paired companion to ring. Characteristic
0000a001-0000-0000-0000-00A57E401D05 notifies one byte: 1 starts,
0 stops. Session bus org.asteroidos.findphone Ring/Stop drives it,
and Stop is sent again after 30 seconds.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [mio hoki patch]
